    "id": "bernardo-friend-context",
    "source": "<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>If this is your truth, then God will love you for it.</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>What you choose to tell others is up to you. But I will always—<i>always</i> be your friend.</indent>\n<b>Bernardo:</b> <indent=16%>There's that, at least.</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>How should I call you?</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>By which I mean, how would you <i>like</i> to be called?",
    "target": "<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>如果这就是真实的你，上帝就会因此爱你。</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>要告诉别人什么，由你自己决定。但我会永远——<i>永远</i>是你的朋友。</indent>\n<b>贝尔纳多:</b> <indent=16%>至少，我还有你这个朋友。</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>我该怎么称呼你？</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>我是说，你<i>希望</i>别人怎么称呼你？",
